## Summary

### New crate: `polkagent-marketplace`

Created `crates/polkagent-marketplace/` with 4 source files:

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Cargo.toml` | Crate manifest with async-trait, serde, chrono, uuid, tokio dependencies |
| `src/lib.rs` | Crate root — re-exports core types and trait |
| `src/types.rs` | Data types: `ServiceListing`, `ServicePricing`, `ServiceAvailability`, `CreateListingRequest`, `SearchFilter` |
| `src/store.rs` | `ServiceRegistryStore` async trait with `create_listing`, `get_listing`, `search` methods + `RegistryError` |
| `src/memory.rs` | `InMemoryServiceRegistry` — full in-memory implementation with 5 passing tests |

Service declarations include **capabilities**, **pricing** (model/unit/price/currency), **availability** (available/maintenance/deprecated/offline), **version**, SLA tier, protocols, and API schema — as specified by PRD-12.

### Modified: `polkagent-api`

**`Cargo.toml`** — Added `polkagent-marketplace` dependency.

**`src/state.rs`** — Added `service_registry_store: Option<Arc<dyn ServiceRegistryStore>>` to `AppState` with a `with_service_registry_store()` builder method (follows the existing optional-store pattern, returns 501 when `None`).

**`src/dto.rs`** — Added registry DTOs: `CreateServiceListingRequest`, `ServiceListingResponse`, `ListServiceListingsResponse`, `SearchListingsQuery`.

**`src/routes/registry.rs`** (new) — Three handlers:
- **`POST /api/v1alpha1/registry/listings`** — Creates a service listing (returns 201)
- **`GET /api/v1alpha1/registry/listings/{id}`** — Gets a listing by UUID
- **`GET /api/v1alpha1/registry/search`** — Discovery API with query params: `q` (free text), `capability` (comma-separated), `tag` (comma-separated), `author` (exact match), `limit`, `offset`

**`src/routes/mod.rs`** — Registered the `registry` module and wired routes into the v1alpha1 router.

### Modified: Workspace `Cargo.toml`

Added `"crates/polkagent-marketplace"` to workspace members.

